<https://example.org/nih-pilot/metadata/grantdocument/9633997> a pilot:GrantDocument ;
    pilot:abstractText "This agreement will utilize animal models to explore the cause of immunopathology in the microenvironment of the vaccinated animal lung following infection with Ebola virus via the aerosol route." ;
